 43	                           Species.SLOTH, Color.YELLOW),
 44	        new PopulationRule(PLANT_CREATION_PROBABILITY, Plant::new,
 45	                           Species.PLANT, Color.GREEN)
 46	    };
 47	    // A shared Weather object between organisms and the simulator
 48	    public static final Weather weather = Weather.getWeather();
 49	
 50	
 51	    // List of animals in the field.
 52	    private List<Organism> organisms;
 53	    // The current state of the field.
